| **Free-installation** | `uvx sl-bigquery-mcp` | STDIO (default), SSE, Streamable-HTTP | Direct execution via uvx without cloning repository |
| **Local deployment** | `git clone` + `uv sync` | STDIO, SSE, Streamable-HTTP | Clone repo, install dependencies, run locally |
| **Remote deployment** | Not available | N/A | No pre-hosted cloud server option provided |

**Notes:**
- No Smithery-related options (no [PROHIBITED] items)
- No Docker-related options (no [PROHIBITED] items)
- The README provides clear free-installation instructions using `uvx`

